From 015c62095e6a6362c4ed642e583ae44b2c6e50bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanjeev Kumar Paul <sanjeevkumarpaul25@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:22:41 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Home redesign: floodlit pitch shader, Lenis +
 ScrollTrigger, pinned how-it-works

- Hero: one primary CTA (Pick your 7) plus a "How scoring works" text link;
  next fixture moved into the hero; CSS word-by-word headline reveal
- FloodlitPitch: three.js + GLSL fullscreen quad (mown stripes, chalk lines,
  corner floodlights, pointer light pool, scroll-dimmed). Lazy-loaded on idle,
  DPR capped, paused off screen/hidden tab, static frame for reduced motion,
  CSS fallback without WebGL2
- PitchDiagram replaces the three numbered feature cards; pinned and
  scroll-scrubbed on desktop, simple line draw on phones
- MotionRoot: Lenis (native touch) synced to GSAP's ticker; declarative
  data-reveal / data-reveal-group / data-count; nothing runs with
  prefers-reduced-motion and on-screen content is never hidden
- Accessibility: skip link, picker announces add/remove via aria-live,
  drop-in "D" badge labelled, hint when all 7 are picked
- Admin link moved from the main nav to the footer

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PtuBR2ekwFULQyM2MqFBuU
