From 49410369eaf8f76b988b0130a85da3998c026cc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanjeev Kumar Paul <sanjeevkumarpaul25@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:40:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Orbital home rehaul + squad mascots in Pick 7

Home
- Replaces the floodlit hero and pitch diagram with an orbital scroll scene:
  faceted footballs (real truncated icosahedra, 12 pentagon + 20 hexagon
  slabs) on a floodlit pitch-planet horizon with stars and satellites.
- One ball per chapter: The draw (White/Red split), The scoresheet (green
  with gold +5 panels), Your seven (navy with 7 lit panels), Thursday 10 pm
  (classic match ball). Scroll flies the featured ball; previous rises
  away, next waits on the horizon. Drag to spin, click to open.
- HUD: scroll hint, Chapters menu, current chapter + 01/04 counter,
  vertical series label. Chapter copy is plain HTML scrolling over a sticky
  stage, so it works without WebGL or JS.
- three.js is dynamic-imported on idle; DPR capped; paused off screen;
  reduced motion swaps balls without flights and stops auto-spin.

Mascots
- Original cartoon footballer for each of the 21 players, generated from
  the player id (skin, hair, eyes, mouth, beard, boots, socks), club kit
  with their initial. Overrides in config/mascots.ts.
- Pick 7: picks hop from the squad chip into the bench along an arc and
  land with a squash and wave; drops tumble off the bench; the rest of the
  bench slides along (FLIP). Chips show each player's face.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PtuBR2ekwFULQyM2MqFBuU
